{"4372700": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Narco Check", "steam_appid": 4372700, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h1>JOIN OUR DISCORD</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4372700/extras/3a39a5d22c30301ae97ad68855047fc9.poster.avif?t=1783272859\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4372700/extras/3a39a5d22c30301ae97ad68855047fc9.webm?t=1783272859\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4372700/extras/3a39a5d22c30301ae97ad68855047fc9.mp4?t=1783272859\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4372700/extras/9d9b37be1384de8495408ed26bbe0576.poster.avif?t=1783272859\" width=736 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4372700/extras/9d9b37be1384de8495408ed26bbe0576.webm?t=1783272859\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4372700/extras/9d9b37be1384de8495408ed26bbe0576.mp4?t=1783272859\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4372700/extras/15f356055290e1458bd4f64528609886.avif?t=1783272859\" width=1560 height=196 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4372700/extras/0f811a7dbe9c49ead15dbcc82935cd7f.poster.avif?t=1783272859\" width=800 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4372700/extras/0f811a7dbe9c49ead15dbcc82935cd7f.webm?t=1783272859\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4372700/extras/0f811a7dbe9c49ead15dbcc82935cd7f.mp4?t=1783272859\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in the early 2000s at the heart of Colombia’s most volatile transit hub, you are tasked with reopening a terminal long reclaimed by the jungle. You’ll step behind the desk where every passport hides a secret and every suitcase holds a potential fortune.<br> <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4372700/extras/1b1b94c62abc721477ce71f4388ff55a.avif?t=1783272859\" width=1560 height=196 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4372700/extras/a856d0578eba9e5c5fe285033a3aeb67.poster.avif?t=1783272859\" width=800 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4372700/extras/a856d0578eba9e5c5fe285033a3aeb67.webm?t=1783272859\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4372700/extras/a856d0578eba9e5c5fe285033a3aeb67.mp4?t=1783272859\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scrutinize passports, flight tickets, and entry permits with a sharp eye. Spot forged stamps, altered dates, and suspicious travel patterns before a high-value target slips through your fingers. Every overlooked detail is a fatal flaw in your security.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4372700/extras/afd367d6fad0c091938d6b40b92096a3.avif?t=1783272859\" width=1560 height=196 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4372700/extras/30003de85d94ba6e17e182567180a887.poster.avif?t=1783272859\" width=800 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4372700/extras/30003de85d94ba6e17e182567180a887.webm?t=1783272859\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4372700/extras/30003de85d94ba6e17e182567180a887.mp4?t=1783272859\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use era-appropriate scanning technology to detect illegal contraband hidden within layers of luggage. When you find high-value goods, you face a career-defining choice: hand them over to the state for prestige, or flip them on the black market to fund your private operations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4372700/extras/8a4c055d9d8c2243f29f83652ec227b7.avif?t=1783272859\" width=1560 height=196 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4372700/extras/b19002a759e684abd894f0f164114d89.poster.avif?t=1783272859\" width=800 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4372700/extras/b19002a759e684abd894f0f164114d89.webm?t=1783272859\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4372700/extras/b19002a759e684abd894f0f164114d89.mp4?t=1783272859\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br>In this terminal, precision is profit. Use manual weighing mechanics to catch excess luggage and issue instant fines. Manage the airport’s official revenue while deciding how much of the &quot;extra&quot; stays in your own pocket.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4372700/extras/6c848e68f24117ba506ef3c5a2c16984.avif?t=1783272859\" width=1560 height=196 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4372700/extras/c4b7ff1ab816876d83f6316cc437bc5f.poster.avif?t=1783272859\" width=800 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4372700/extras/c4b7ff1ab816876d83f6316cc437bc5f.webm?t=1783272859\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4372700/extras/c4b7ff1ab816876d83f6316cc437bc5f.mp4?t=1783272859\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with a jungle-choked wreck and transform it into a functional hub. Clean the floors, repair rusted gates, and upgrade your stations. As the workload increases, hire assistants to speed up the process and turn your terminal into a modern transit power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4372700/extras/4393e01f6aa4902701cfc5278939274b.avif?t=1783272859\" width=1560 height=196 /></span>Fill the jail cells with criminals to earn a reputation as an honest officer, or gain the cartels' trust by looking the other way. In this dangerous world, honesty offers safety, but corruption offers an empire. How will you play the system?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline 