k market to fund your private operations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4372700/extras/8a4c055d9d8c2243f29f83652ec227b7.avif?t=1783272859\" width=1560 height=196 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4372700/extras/b19002a759e684abd894f0f164114d89.poster.avif?t=1783272859\" width=800 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4372700/extras/b19002a759e684abd894f0f164114d89.webm?t=1783272859\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4372700/extras/b19002a759e684abd894f0f164114d89.mp4?t=1783272859\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br>In this terminal, precision is profit. Use manual weighing mechanics to catch excess luggage and issue instant fines. Manage the airport’s official revenue while deciding how much of the &quot;extra&quot; stays in your own pocket.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4372700/extras/6c848e68f24117ba506ef3c5a2c16984.avif?t=1783272859\" width=1560 height=196 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4372700/extras/c4b7ff1ab816876d83f6316cc437bc5f.poster.avif?t=1783272859\" width=800 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4372700/extras/c4b7ff1ab816876d83f6316cc437bc5f.webm?t=1783272859\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4372700/extras/c4b7ff1ab816876d83f6316cc437bc5f.mp4?t=1783272859\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with a jungle-choked wreck and transform it into a functional hub. Clean the floors, repair rusted gates, and upgrade your stations. As the workload increases, hire assistants to speed up the process and turn your terminal into a modern transit power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4372700/extras/4393e01f6aa4902701cfc5278939274b.avif?t=1783272859\" width=1560 height=196 /></span>Fill the jail cells with criminals to earn a reputation as an honest officer, or gain the cartels' trust by looking the other way. In this dangerous world, honesty offers safety, but corruption offers an empire. How will you play the system?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Revive an abandoned airport in 2000s Colombia. Verify documents, stop smuggling with X-ray scans, and upgrade your terminal. Will you stay a loyal officer or collaborate with the cartels to rot the system from within? Every stamp and every bribe leads you either to justice or to a dark fortune.", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Simplified Chinese, Portuguese - Brazil, Traditional Chinese, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Russian, Turkish, Ukrainian, Portuguese - Portugal", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4372700/2162b53e0d0c31da35352ed24c35472362809a11/header.jpg?t=1783272859", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4372700/083fde4aeddf73c5a09b8c53777dc39de162078b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1783272859", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4372700/083fde4aeddf73c5a09b8c53777dc39de162078b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1783272859", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</st